      "solution_text": "Since $\\pi$ radians equals $180^\\circ$, multiply by $\\frac{180^\\circ}{\\pi}$. Thus $\\frac{\\pi}{12}\\times\\frac{180^\\circ}{\\pi}=15^\\circ$."
